665年11月30日，西班牙国王费利佩四世的遗孀奥地利的玛丽亚纳批准了古巴的纹章盾牌，该盾牌以哈瓦那的前三座城堡为象征图案：皇家富尔扎城堡、特雷斯桑托斯雷耶斯马格斯德尔莫罗城堡和圣萨尔瓦多德拉蓬塔。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q1563","articleTitle":"哈瓦那","sourceRevision":94362617,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 哈瓦那","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%93%88%E7%93%A6%E9%82%A3"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94362617"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1563"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159149835","name":"圣地亚哥－德古巴","country":"CUB","lat":20.02502,"lon":-75.82133,"kind":"city","region":"CU-13","rank":4,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"圣地亚哥－德古巴 · 地点概要","geo":"联合国教科文组织颁布的世界遗产圣佩德罗德拉罗卡城堡位于此市。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q117040","articleTitle":"圣地亚哥 (古巴)","sourceRevision":94671626,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 圣地亚哥 (古巴)","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E5%9C%B0%E4%BA%9A%E5%93%A5%20%28%E5%8F%A4%E5%B7%B4%29"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94671626"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q117040"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159146919","name":"比那尔德里奥","country":"CUB","lat":22.41751,"lon":-83.69808,"kind":"city","region":"CU-01","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159146921","name":"卡马圭","country":"CUB","lat":21.38083,"lon":-77.91693,"kind":"city","region":"CU-09","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"卡马圭 · 地点概要","geo":"2008年7月，卡马圭旧城被联合国教科文组织列为世界遗产。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q115329","articleTitle":"卡馬圭","sour